== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @skirt steak{7/20%lb}, @romaine hearts{2/5} (chopped), @tomatoes{2/5} (diced), @red bell pepper{1/5} (sliced), @green bell pepper{1/5} (sliced), @jicama{1/10} (julienned), @cucumber{1/5} (julienned), @red onion{1/10} (thinly sliced), @cilantro{1/20%cup}, @olive oil{3/5%tbsp}, @balsamic vinegar{3/5%tbsp}, @gluten-free tamari{2/5%tbsp}, @honey{2/5%tsp}, @lemon juice{1/5%tbsp}, @red pepper flakes{1/20%tsp}, @Salt + black pepper{}.

== Preparation ==

Whisk oil, vinegar, tamari, honey and lemon into a dressing. Sear the steak, rest and slice thinly. Toss the vegetables and cilantro with dressing and top with steak.
